# Vendored hls.js runtime build — required by src/hlsjsplayer/HlsJsPlayer.ts and the app
# build, so it must be tracked despite the broad `dist` rule above. Only the .mjs bundle is
# needed; its source map and the other variants stay ignored.
!src/hlsjsplayer/dist/
src/hlsjsplayer/dist/*
!src/hlsjsplayer/dist/hls.mjs